<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Cricket-Ireland face defeat by Somerset.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Ireland face defeat by Somerset.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland had run up a total of just 85 runs for six wickets after 15.5 overs in their Benson and Hedges Cup match against Somerset at Taunton on Friday.</p>
<p>Somerset finished with a total of 349 runs for seven wickets earlier in the day.</p>
<p>--Dublin newsroom 353-1-66377.</p>
</text>
